**Admin Features**:
- ✓ Complete inventory management with cover images
- ✓ Category management
- ✓ Order processing and status updates
- ✓ Sales analytics and statistics
- ✓ Stock level monitoring

**Order Lifecycle**:
- ✓ Pending → Confirmed (Observer triggers inventory update)
- ✓ Confirmed → Shipped
- ✓ Shipped → Delivered
- ✓ Pending → Canceled (customer or admin)

